{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/383","id":165713803,"node_id":"MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0MTY1NzEzODAz","html_url":"https://github.com/nestjs/nest/pull/383","diff_url":"https://github.com/nestjs/nest/pull/383.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/nestjs/nest/pull/383.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/issues/383","number":383,"state":"closed","locked":true,"title":"feat(@nestjs/common) improve the ValidationPipe","user":{"login":"fwoelffel","id":5467696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Njc2OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5467696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel","html_url":"https://github.com/fwoelffel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"**TLDR;** This PR adds some options to the `ValidationPipe`.\r\n\r\n## Motivation\r\n\r\nTake the following code base:\r\n```js\r\n// pagination.dto.ts\r\nimport { IsInt, IsOptional, IsPositive } from \"class-validator\";\r\nimport { Type } from \"class-transformer\";\r\nexport class PaginationOptionsDto {\r\n  @IsInt()\r\n  @IsPositive()\r\n  @IsOptional()\r\n  @Type(() => Number)\r\n  readonly offset?: number;\r\n\r\n  @IsInt()\r\n  @IsPositive()\r\n  @IsOptional()\r\n  @Type(() => Number)\r\n  readonly limit?: number;\r\n}\r\n```\r\n```js\r\n// users.controller.ts\r\n// ...\r\n/**\r\n * A `GET` request against the `/users?name=James&offset=20&limit=10` endpoint\r\n * should return a paginated list of the users named James.\r\n */\r\n@Get('users')\r\nasync getUsers(\r\n  @Query(new ValidationPipe()) pagination?: PaginationOptionsDto,\r\n  @Query('name') nameFilter?: string\r\n) {\r\n  console.log(pagination instanceof PaginationOptionsDto);\r\n  console.log(pagination);\r\n  return this.usersService.getUsers({name: nameFilter}, pagination);\r\n}\r\n// ...\r\n```\r\nNow if you take a look at the console output, you will see that:\r\n- `pagination` is not an instance of `PaginationOptionsDto` which can cause issues if you want to define some methods in this class.\r\n- `pagination` is an object (`any`) equal to `{name: 'James', offset: 20, limit: 10}`.\r\n\r\nWeird, uh? I know that \"since it's a **validation** pipe it should only perform validation\", but still... weird.\r\n\r\n## Proposal\r\n\r\nThis PR adds the support of the following options to the `ValidationPipe`:\r\n- `transform`: The pipe will return an instance of the expected type.\r\n- `strip`: The pipe will return an instance of the expected type **without** the extra properties (ie: the `name` property on the example above). This option implicitly sets `transform` to true.\r\n- `reject`: The pipe will throw an error if it finds any unexpected property. This option implicitly sets `transform` and `strip` to true.\r\n\r\nThis is what it looks like:\r\n```js\r\n@Get('/users')\r\nasync getUsers(\r\n  @Query(new TransformationPipe({strip: true})) pagination?: PaginationOptionsDto,\r\n  @Query('name') nameFilter?: string\r\n) {\r\n  console.log(pagination instanceof PaginationOptionsDto); // true\r\n  console.log(pagination); // {limit: 10, offset: 20}\r\n  return this.usersService.getUsers(pagination, {name: nameFilter});\r\n}\r\n```\r\n\r\nThis makes use of the `class-validator` latest release which provides the [whitelisting feature](https://github.com/typestack/class-validator#whitelisting).","created_at":"2018-01-29T14:09:07Z","updated_at":"2019-09-23T17:12:18Z","closed_at":"2018-02-11T11:27:18Z","merged_at":"2018-02-11T11:27:18Z","merge_commit_sha":"27c083985cf5c319de700344b431bbff54e3d7e9","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/383/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/383/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/issues/383/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nestjs/nest/statuses/27c083985cf5c319de700344b431bbff54e3d7e9","head":{"label":"fwoelffel:improve-validation-pipe","ref":"improve-validation-pipe","sha":"27c083985cf5c319de700344b431bbff54e3d7e9","user":{"login":"fwoelffel","id":5467696,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU0Njc2OTY=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5467696?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel","html_url":"https://github.com/fwoelffel","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fwoelffel/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":null},"base":{"label":"nestjs:master","ref":"master","sha":"18125677b203e437b467a777ad2b7decfe6d9a25","user":{"login":"nestjs","id":28507035,"node_id